{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_21_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_21","textTraditional":"一、十年，春王正月，庚申，曹伯終生卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_21_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_21","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，葬曹桓公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_21_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_21","textTraditional":"三、秋，公會衞侯于桃丘，弗遇。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_21_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_21","textTraditional":"會者何？期辭也。其言弗遇何？公不見要也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_21_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_21","textTraditional":"四、冬，十有二月丙午，齊侯、衞侯、鄭伯來戰于郎。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_21_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_21","textTraditional":"郎者何？吾近邑也。吾近邑則其言來戰于郎何？近也。惡乎近？近乎圍也。此偏戰也，何以不言師敗績？內不言戰，言戰乃敗矣。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}